title: Payers › Changes › A change with no drafts
route: /payers/harborview?tab=changes
intro: Not every change touches many drafts. Harborview's portal form change affects one draft and adds no documents. A change that affected no drafts would change the wording of the banner, the button and the confirm step; the seed data has none, so that branch is not reachable in the demo. A payer with nothing waiting shows only history.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open the 'Changes' tab\nfor a payer"
decision dp "Is a change waiting?"
screen up "Green banner\n'This payer's rules are up to date'\nOnly the 'What changed' history below"
process hv "Harborview's waiting change\n'Portal form change', effective 10/18\nThe request form now asks for the expected length of stay and a second contact.\nThe old form closes 10/31."
decision dn "How many drafts does the change affect?"
toast one "'Packet can redraft the 1 draft that is not yet sent: P-1499.'\nButtons: 'Acknowledge change', then 'Update 1 draft'"
toast none "'No open drafts are affected.'\nButtons: 'Acknowledge change', then 'Apply to new drafts'\n(no seeded change has this)"
click ca1 "Click 'Acknowledge change' and confirm,\nthen 'Update 1 draft'"
click ca0 "Click 'Acknowledge change' and confirm,\nthen 'Apply to new drafts'"
overlay mo "Update 1 draft?\nRow: P-1499 · E.S., 42 · Harborview, PHP,\n'Answer drafted, not yet sent'"
overlay mn "Apply to new drafts?\nNo open drafts are affected.\nHarborview will use the change for every new draft from now on."
agent a1 "Packet is redrafting 1 draft\n(its agents are Packet and Integrity)"
agent a2 "Integrity is checking every sentence against the chart"
process da "No documents are added to Harborview's lists\nThe change is about a form, not the list"
store s1d "P-1499 needs a person again\n'Redrafted after Harborview's change (portal form change).\nWaiting for a new signature'"
store s0 "No drafts touched\nChange cleared, checked date is today\nSame three-second wait"
store hh "'What changed' gets a new top row\n'Portal form change: acknowledged and applied'"
store hh0 "'What changed' gets a new top row\n'... acknowledged and applied'\nsaying 0 drafts were updated"
toast t1 "'1 draft updated'\nHarborview is up to date. Each draft returned to Case Manager\nfor a new signature."
toast t0 "'0 drafts updated'\n(the wording is not adjusted for none)"
process bd "Sidebar badge drops from 2 to 1\nPayer dot turns green"
click cx "Click 'Cancel', press Escape,\nclick the X or the dimmed area"
endx x1 "Modal closes, change stays waiting"
end e1 "Payer is up to date"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Changes › Update drafts after a change"

s1 --> dp
dp -->|No| up --> e1
dp -->|Yes| hv --> dn
dn -->|One draft| one --> ca1 --> mo
dn -->|No drafts| none --> ca0 --> mn
mo --> a1 --> a2 --> da --> s1d --> hh
mn --> s0 --> hh0 --> t0 --> e1
hh --> t1 --> bd --> e1
mo --> cx --> x1
mn --> cx
mo -.-> g1
